      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really strong start, super atmospheric. I love the 'trapped animal' line. To make it even more authentic, could you expand on that group of people on the corners? I want to be able to really visualize who they are—specifically their physical appearance, what they're wearing, and maybe some more specific details about their skin tones or ethnic backgrounds to ground the setting in a specific type of urban environment. I want the reader to immediately recognize the demographic vibe of a place like that.",
